    <li><a href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing">OpenAI API pricing</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing">DeepSeek models and pricing</a></li>
  </ul></div>
</KnowledgeLayout>
